WEBVTT

00:13:27.949 --> 00:13:30.301
and it actually works
really beautifully together.

00:13:30.325 --> 00:13:32.349
And I actually think
it works the same way.

00:13:32.373 --> 00:13:35.578
You need to have the people-people,
the communicators,

00:13:35.602 --> 00:13:37.029
the warm and friendly people

00:13:37.053 --> 00:13:38.775
who like --

00:13:38.799 --> 00:13:40.241
(Laughter)

00:13:40.265 --> 00:13:43.315
really want to hug you
and get you into the community.

00:13:43.339 --> 00:13:44.910
But that's not everybody.

00:13:44.934 --> 00:13:46.366
And that's not me.

00:13:46.390 --> 00:13:47.847
I care about the technology.

00:13:47.871 --> 00:13:49.752
There are people who care about the UI.

00:13:49.776 --> 00:13:52.846
I can't do UI to save my life.

00:13:52.870 --> 00:13:55.891
I mean, if I was stranded on an island

00:13:55.915 --> 00:13:59.315
and the only way to get off that island
was the make a pretty UI,

00:13:59.339 --> 00:14:00.502
I'd die there.